{"id":"n65570-1-8","stage":0,"title":"버리다 · 扔","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65570-1-8-1","ko":"왜 옷들을 밖에 가지고 나오셨어요?","zh":"为什么把衣服拿到外面来了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷들을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"가지다：用，拿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"9","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오셨어요?","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"用，拿","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"把某物作为工具或材料、手段或方法。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6cf14f79e6c6df991e9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65570-1-8-2","ko":"안 입는 옷들이라 버리려고요.","zh":"因为是不用穿的衣服，所以打算扔掉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입는","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷들이라","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버리려고요.","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"